    {"t": "h2", "text": "Multiple users, roles and separation"},
    {"t": "p", "text": "The database contains 16 users: the individual, researcher and admin demonstration accounts, 12 seeded cohort participants, and one additional test account. Profiles are one-to-one with users. Personal analyses, sessions, baselines, reports and signal assets all carry a user_id, and the API scopes reads and writes to the signed-in user. Institution endpoints require the researcher or admin role; an individual receives 403. In the live check, demo@aurasense.app received \u201cYour role does not have access to this resource\u201d from /api/institution/overview."},
