    {"t": "h2", "text": "How analyses are saved and retrieved"},
    {"t": "p", "text": "All result-producing paths call analysis_service._persist, which inserts an AnalysisResult with the user, optional session/dataset links, title, provenance, model version, predicted class and label, confidence, entropy uncertainty, stress probability, class-probability JSON, quality score/grade/issues, measured features, imputed features, explanation JSON, window count, duration, notes and demo flag. The frontend retrieves recent records with GET /api/analysis and one record with GET /api/analysis/{id}; both enforce ownership."},

    {"t": "h2", "text": "PDF generation is real"},
