    {"t": "p", "text": "The audit found seven PDF files (one orphaned after a report record was deleted) ranging from 1,991 to 5,995 bytes and 1\u20133 pages. The analysis reports inspected were 2 pages and about 4.4 KB; the research report was 3 pages and about 6.0 KB; the institution report was 1 page and about 2.0 KB. These are small, text/vector PDFs, not scanned images."},
    {"t": "p", "text": "Reports include the model version (for analysis reports), evaluation strategy (for research reports), and aggregate window/cohort metadata. They do not include a cryptographic signature, immutable version history, a full per-window table or raw signals. A report reflects the stored analysis at generation time; changing the model later does not retroactively change an old report."},
    {"t": "h2", "text": "Limitations"},
